      // the coloured line on the border: a thin, near-solid trace laid down
      // behind the head, like the filled part of ColorOS's progress bar
      // dots 1.5px apart: without the old drop-shadow to blur them, wider
      // spacing shows as beads
      // the trace's colour moves on a little faster near the head (k ** 0.75)
      // so the near-white stretch behind the head stays short
      // Light mode beaded here (dark ink on paper shows what glow on dark
